# The 96 MB puzzle CSV is sourced from the Laravel repo at build time; do not commit it here.
Goldens/*.tmp

# The generated puzzle DB is deliberately NOT ignored. It is built from the 550k-row CSV in the
# sibling Laravel repo, which codemagic.yaml never sees — CI clones this repo alone — so the
# 33 MB DemoApp/Sources/BiyaherongUI/puzzles.sqlite has to be tracked. Regenerate it with
# tools/puzzlebank/build_puzzles.py; the build is deterministic, so an unchanged corpus produces
# no diff. (The line that used to sit here named DemoApp/Sources/DemoApp/puzzles.sqlite, a path
# that has not existed for several phases.)
Goldens/

# Claude Code: per-task worktrees live here (see the Workflow section of CLAUDE.md). Never committed.
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/settings.local.json

# App Store Connect API private keys - NEVER commit these
AuthKey_*.p8
*.p8
